@* 横向的虚拟列表（一千张照片也只渲染看得见的几张）；@ref 拿到组件，跳到指定的一张 *@
@inherits RuneComponent

<Flex Direction="LayoutDirection.Column" Gap="SpaceScale.Md">
    <VirtualList @ref="album" Items="Photos" GetKey="p => p.Id" Horizontal="true" EstimateSize="136" Overscan="2" aria-label="相册" Sx="ListSize" Context="photo"
                 data-testid="album">
        <div style="@($"background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl({photo.Hue} 70% 55%), hsl({(photo.Hue + 40) % 360} 70% 40%))")" @attributes="Attrs.Merge(PhotoLayer)">@photo.Title</div>
    </VirtualList>
    <Flex Gap="SpaceScale.Sm" Align="ItemAlign.Center" Wrap="true">
        <NumberField @bind-Value="target" Min="1" Max="1000" Size="Size.Sm" aria-label="跳到第几张" />
        <Button Size="Size.Sm" Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Tone="Tone.Neutral" @onclick="Jump">跳过去</Button>
        <Small Tone="TextTone.Muted">只渲染看得见的几张，前后各多 2 张（Overscan）</Small>
    </Flex>
</Flex>

@code {
    sealed record Photo(int Id, int Hue, string Title);

    static readonly Photo[] Photos = [.. Enumerable.Range(0, 1000).Select(index => new Photo(index, index * 37 % 360, $"第 {index + 1} 张"))];

    static readonly Attrs PhotoLayer = new()
    {
        Sx = Css.Define(static () => new Style
        {
            Display = Display.Grid,
            PlaceItems = "end start",
            BoxSizing = BoxSizing.BorderBox,
            Width = CssLength.Rem(8),
            Height = CssLength.Rem(8),
            MarginInlineEnd = Space.Sm,
            Padding = Space.Sm,
            BorderRadius = Radii.Md,
            Color = "white",
            FontSize = FontSizes.Sm,
            FontWeight = FontWeights.Semibold,
        }),
    };

    static Style ListSize => Css.Define(static () => new Style { Width = CssLength.Percent(100), Height = CssLength.Rem(8.5) });

    VirtualList<Photo>? album;
    double? target = 500;

    void Jump() => album?.ScrollToIndex((int)(target ?? 1) - 1, ScrollAlign.Start);
}
